graph TB
    subgraph MLMD["ML Metadata (MLMD)"]
        direction TB
        Server["metadata_store_server<br/>C++ gRPC Service<br/>Port 8080/TCP"]
        Proto["MetadataStoreService Proto<br/>~47 RPC Methods"]
        Server -->|implements| Proto

        subgraph Adapters["Database Adapters"]
            SQLiteAdapter["SQLite Adapter"]
            MySQLAdapter["MySQL Adapter"]
            PGAdapter["PostgreSQL Adapter"]
        end

        Server -->|connects via| SQLiteAdapter
        Server -->|connects via| MySQLAdapter
        Server -->|connects via| PGAdapter
    end

    subgraph PythonLib["ml_metadata Python Library"]
        SWIGClient["SWIG-Wrapped C++<br/>(Direct Access)"]
        GRPCClient["gRPC Client<br/>(Remote Access)"]
    end

    PipelineComponent["Data Science Pipelines<br/>(gRPC Client)"] -->|gRPC/8080| Server
    GRPCClient -->|gRPC/8080| Server
    SWIGClient -->|in-process| SQLiteAdapter

    MySQLAdapter -->|3306/TCP| MySQL["MySQL / MariaDB"]
    PGAdapter -->|5432/TCP| PostgreSQL["PostgreSQL"]
    SQLiteAdapter -->|local file| SQLiteDB["SQLite File"]

    style Server fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Proto fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style SQLiteAdapter fill:#6baed6
    style MySQLAdapter fill:#6baed6
    style PGAdapter fill:#6baed6
    style SWIGClient fill:#9ecae1
    style GRPCClient fill:#9ecae1
    style PipelineComponent fill:#7ed321
    style MySQL fill:#f5a623
    style PostgreSQL fill:#f5a623
    style SQLiteDB fill:#f5a623
